{
  "about": [
    "Every file served with the year-long immutable cache (fonts/ and media/ under src/app/public), every vendored bundle, and where each came from.",
    "files: each shipped file's sha256 and the asset it belongs to. A font or media path always means the same bytes: a changed file gets a new name,",
    "the old one stays deployed, and its users move to the new name (README, Deploy).",
    "assets: what each one is, how it was made (made), and which site files load it (consumers). sources: the third-party originals, with",
    "author, license, and source_url. Where only the creator's profile or the library's home is known, source_url says so in exactness; nothing",
    "here is a guessed asset page. The Blender files, recipes (blender/*.py), and the owner's photos the yard was fitted to live in the owner's",
    "private planning folder, not this repository.",
    "scripts/manifest.py checks this file (make manifest, part of make check) and refreshes the hashes (make rehash);",
    "scripts/models.cjs checks the models against the code that names their parts (make models, part of make check)."
  ],
