      "made": "Sunflowers weathered and posed in a bed, tomatoes in wire cages, and squash on trellises, stretched, recolored, and rendered in Blender (blender/yard.blend, the owner's private planning folder) with their own shadows, among Poly Haven weeds and grass clumps.",
